00:09:16.951 --> 00:09:20.984
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:21.583 --> 00:09:33.008
<v Slow>ことし1月から8月までに、廃業や倒産などをしたコメ農家は、合わせて何件でしたか。

00:09:33.807 --> 00:09:35.152
<v Host>Thirty-two.

00:09:35.751 --> 00:09:43.744
<v Slow>コメ作りをやめる農家が多い、大きな理由の一つは何ですか。

00:09:44.543 --> 00:09:48.600
<v Host>The aging of farmers — the average owner is over sixty.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:58.799
<v Slow>ことしの新米を農協が買い取る価格は、去年と比べてどうなる見通しですか。

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.727
<v Host>It is expected to be twenty to forty percent lower than last year.

00:10:04.327 --> 00:10:15.583
<v Host>That's all for today. Record prices last year, yet record closures this year — Japan's rice farming is at a turning point. See you next time on Japanese Daily News.

00:10:16.183 --> 00:10:18.583
<v News>また明日。
